      "rationale": "All distinct license status categories named in any state's sentences were included in the union; synonyms and trivially different phrasings (e.g., 'retired status license' and 'retired license') were merged into one canonical entry, while genuinely distinct categories (e.g., academic license, graduate registered physician license, expedited compact license) were kept separate; items appearing only in exclusion or prohibition contexts (e.g., suspended, revoked, surrendered) were retained as in-scope categories.",
